[url=/about_nan][color=BLUE]ABOUT NAN[/color][/url]
[b]Recipe of the day:[/b]
[img]res://images/img_muffins.jpg[/img]
beat 2 eggs
add 4oz of oil
add 5oz of milk and mix
add 8oz of sugar and mix
add a dash of salt and 3 1/2 oz of flour then mix
add mixture to muffin tray and cook for 20 minutes

[color=#00000000]<!-- nan! ive moved ur secret recipes to /secret_recipes.html, plz dont share that link with anyone!! - jimmy -->[/color]"
